{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"PushwooshFramework"}],"symbolKind":"typealias","externalID":"c:PWTypes.h@T@PushwooshRegistrationHandler","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PushwooshRegistrationHandler","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Type Alias","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PushwooshRegistrationHandler"}],"title":"PushwooshRegistrationHandler"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshframework\/pushwooshregistrationhandler"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"typedef"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"void (^)(NSString *, NSError *)","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:BFv(#*$objc(cs)NSString#*$objc(cs)NSError)"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"PushwooshRegistrationHandler","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This closure is called when the device registration process finishes, either successfully or with an error."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The handler receives two parameters:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"token"}]},{"type":"text","text":": The push token string if registration succeeded, or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":" if it failed","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"error","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": An error object if registration failed, or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" if it succeeded"}]}]}]},{"text":"Example","anchor":"Example","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Handle registration result with UI updates and backend sync:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["func registerForNotifications() {","    let registrationHandler: PushwooshRegistrationHandler = { token, error in","        if let error = error {","            self.logger.error(\"Push registration failed: \\(error.localizedDescription)\")","            self.updateNotificationStatus(.failed)","            return","        }","","        guard let token = token else { return }","","        self.logger.info(\"Push token received: \\(token.prefix(20))...\")","        self.updateNotificationStatus(.registered)","","        self.syncPushTokenWithBackend(token)","    }","","    Pushwoosh.configure.registerForPushNotifications(withCompletion: registrationHandler)","}","","func syncPushTokenWithBackend(_ token: String) {","    let hwid = Pushwoosh.configure.getHWID()","    apiClient.post(\"\/devices\/register\", body: [","        \"push_token\": token,","        \"hwid\": hwid,","        \"platform\": \"ios\"","    ])","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Completion handler called when push notification registration completes.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshiOS\/documentation\/PushwooshFramework\/PushwooshRegistrationHandler"},"sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshiOS\/documentation\/PushwooshFramework\/PushwooshErrorHandler"],"title":"Related Documentation"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshiOS\/documentation\/PushwooshFramework"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshiOS/documentation/PushwooshFramework/PushwooshRegistrationHandler":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Completion handler called when push notification registration completes.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshframework\/pushwooshregistrationhandler","type":"topic","identifier":"doc